<title>CUBA: TENNIS-PERU BEAT CUBA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PERU BEAT CUBA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HAVANA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru beat Cuba 3-2 in their Davis</p>
<p>Cup American zone group two first round tie:</p>
<p>Results of Sunday's reverse singles (Cuban names first):</p>
<p>Juan Antonio Pino beat Jaime Yzaga 4-6 7-6 (7-4) 1-0 (Yzaga</p>
<p>disqualified)</p>
<p>Lazaro Navarro lost to Americo Venero 6-7  (5-7) 3-6 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-2 6-8</p>
</text>
